oracle: rustc 1.97.0 (2d8144b78 2026-07-07), the release's own compiler, run on the host (slice C2 pins and records toolchains).
command: rustc --edition <E> --crate-type lib --emit=metadata FILE   # FILE is the case wrapped as: macro_rules! m { ($($t:tt)*) => {} } m!{ <case> }
